<title>USA: Health Care sells shares to Cohen &amp; Steers.</title>
<headline>Health Care sells shares to Cohen &amp; Steers.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Care REIT Inc said Thursday 1,575,800 shares have been purchased by Cohen &amp; Steers Capital Management Inc for its clients.</p>
<p>Health Care said proceeds will be used to invest in additional health care properties.</p>
<p>It said Cohen &amp; Steers has become its largest institutional shareholder.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
